WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.400
Meet Mara. She handles bids for a specialist photonics supplier. Broad alerts can turn one morning into a long sorting job.

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:14.200
PhotonBid is an early research concept. The official notice always takes precedence.

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:23.200
Mara adds the supplier catalogue, including product family, wavelength, resolution, accessories, service region, and eligibility limits.

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:30.400
PhotonBid is designed to monitor official European notices and compare their requirements with those catalogue details.

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:39.200
When something may fit, it explains why. Here, wavelength and resolution align, while service coverage and eligibility still need checking.

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:48.600
A concise email gives Mara the title, buyer, deadline, available value, quoted evidence, questions, a possible deal breaker, and the official source.

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:53.200
She reads the email and opens the source before deciding what deserves attention.

00:00:53.200 --> 00:01:01.152
The goal is a calmer first review, not a guaranteed result. PhotonBid does not write bids or decide eligibility.
